55:- Signed delta, five-lens average vs attempt 1's 78.5: **+1.5** — *instrument-changed (4-lens → 5-lens, readability added), not pure movement.*
56:- Reading of the delta: on the four comparable lenses the movement is **+0.5** (78.5 → 79.0), a bundled outcome of the attempt's construction changes (per-mechanism diagnostics in the build record prove each mechanism operates; they do not attribute lens movement per mechanism). The remaining +1.0 of the headline delta is the instrument effect of adding the readability lens at 84. Per shared lens: timing +11, purity 0, motion −3, reusability −6.
58:**Bar:** average ≥ 85 AND no lens under 70 (applied to the five-lens average).
