Five-lens Codex wave (INSTRUCTION §5.4, Amendment A5 form). Returns filed verbatim in `codex/lens-<lens>.md`; instruction files `codex/instr-<lens>.txt`. Each run was separate; no lens saw another.

| Lens | Score | Return |
|---|---|---|
