### T244 — Karaoke word-highlight captions as the transcript device (P14 T05) ◆ — OWED #109
- Tier: **DESCRIBED — OWED #109**
- Mechanics: the creator's own burned-in captions sit in a fixed bottom band; the currently spoken word renders in full white while the rest of the line sits dimmed, so the highlight sweeps the line in reading order, word by word, locked to the voice. In a faceless piece the moving highlight is the persona's visible speech act. (Highlight sweep timing is the mechanic — OWED, clip-cited; precedent T195. The caption is the specimen's own — this library adds no captions to any sample. Its lesson also registers asset-side as a variant under AS-82.)
- Feeds: word animation — P14 @ throughout (bottom band) — ev/066-house-scene.jpg, ev/080-house-clock-verdict.jpg · clips/000-bayes-board-build.mp4


