    73	**DOM spans + pure stateAt(CONFIG,t)** (T195 precedent): one span per word, colour = lerp(dim, spoken, fill) where fill comes from stateAt; RTL via dir="rtl" + reading-order word array. Rejected: canvas particle/text sampling (A1 typography precedent is for particle formation — this technique has no formation, only colour state; canvas would add nothing and cost readability) · CSS keyframes (timing not CONFIG-derivable; swap test could not move evaluation instants) · traced frame sequence (refusal-class, §6.1).
